  <widget type = "label" version = "2.0.0">
    <name>label_23685</name>
    <x>13</x>
    <y>319</y>
    <width>572</width>
    <height>89</height>
    <text>NOTE: Local Vapor Controller Indicates Temperature\nin deg C\n\nNOTE:  There is a 10k difference between 3TPNG and\nSet Point.\nReson: Controller use T/C at the heater outlet while\na TP is in the bayonet can.</text>
